Report example:
[^Bolt Business Team 24.11.2025 - 24.11.2025 @ 25.11.2025 17_16 Bolt Business Card Reconciliation.pdf] 
Date range (24/11/2025 - 24/11/2025), I only topped up our account with €102.24 and then withdrew €102.24 that day.

We do not calculate the Available balance and Ledger balance data ourselves, but take it from Marqeta transactions.

I am confused by the fact that the numbers do not match completely.

The Δavailable/Δledger = ‑100.00 EUR even though the GPA debit was 102.24 EUR. That means something else in that period offset 2.24 EUR (e.g., a small card spend, fee, or pending adjustment) before the snapshot we captured. The report can only reflect what Marqeta's GPA state actually was at each boundary; it does not recomputes the balances manually.
So, it appears that I will have to test this more and figure out what is causing the inconsistencies.


