*PREREQUISITES:*

* PIM fee storage is amended.
** Remove unique constraint over (external_id, region_id).
** {{FeeCron}} is amended to upsert all fees with matching external_id.
** Other logic in PIM is amended to avoid the assumption that a fee has a unique external ID within a region.
** New optional field is added for PIM fees: {{menu_sync_type}}, supporting values {{city_fee}}, {{city_fee_with_custom_sku}}, {{custom_fee}}
*** {{FeeCron}} uses only {{city_fee}}, when setting up new fees.
*** Other types are only used by the Menu system during sync.
** *Why:*
*** City fee SKU customization enabler.
*** Otherwise, we lose the link from PIM fee -> city-level fee after the first PIM -> Menu sync.
*** The type field assists in the execution of Menu -> PIM sync.
*** Easier to identify what happened in the system later on.
* {{BoltMenuNodeBuilder}} logic for building fee node IDs is amended:
** To identify fees, use {{{externalId}_{feeType}_{pimFeeDbID}_{menuSyncType}}} as node ID instead of {{fee:{feeSku}}}
** *Why?*
*** This node ID becomes the trace ID during PIM -> Menu sync.
*** We are then always able to extract the city-level fee ID ({{external_id}}) from the trace ID.
*** We can also extract the immutable PIM fee ID from the trace ID, and treat it as close-enough to GUID in certain cases.

